  "description": "The bone-to-bone retarget profile from the humanoid skeleton to the stylized one: every bone is mapped by hand to its counterpart (rotation interpolated for the body, one to one for the root) and the pelvis also carries its translation, globally scaled to the shorter character. A profile maps either by bone like this or by IK rig chain (see the IK Retargeter example), not both. The root policy scales automatically from the two hip heights."
